<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK LATVIJA FEB PROFIT 88,200 LATS. [CORRECTED 17:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK LATVIJA FEB PROFIT 88,200 LATS. [CORRECTED 17:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to make clear that February profit was 88,200 lats)</p>
<p>Hansapank said on Tuesday that the profit of its Latvian subsidiary, Hansapank Latvija, for the first two month of 1997 was 231,200 lats.</p>
<p>The subsidiary's February's profit was 88,200 lats, down from January's 143 000 lats.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
